          "incoming": "\"*Friday the 13th. The Old Yard. The handed crossing, called; four tries before the Marshal, on the Low Lane's mast, unsanctioned. Finch, two wards, 0.12. Cade, two stances, 0.06. Rowan, Embers, off her own thimble. Spent, 0.18. Held, three and six hundredths.*\" He shut the book. \"Sealed, eight-tenths. That adds.\"",
